  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nPython 3.5 has [reached End-Of-Life](https://endoflife.date/python) on the 13th of September, deprecating this could open up synapse to (for example):\r\n- f-string literals (#8332)\r\n- Variable typing annotations (#8351)\r\n- Async generators\r\n- Async list literals (or \"comprehensions\")\r\n\r\n([3.6 release notes](https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.6.html))",
